#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We have a :ref:`Krita Brush tip page <brush_tip_animated_brush>` on how to "
"create your own GIH brush."
msgstr ""
"Imamo :ref:'Krita Krtača nasvet stran ' o tem, kako ustvariti svoj "
"<brush_tip_animated_brush>GIH čopič."
